<%provide :title, "Change Email, Email Sent"%>

<div class="col-xs-10 col-md-8">
  <div class="panel panel-primary">
    <div class="panel-heading">
      <h1>We sent you an email to confirm your new email address!</h1>
    </div>
    <div class="panel-body">
    	<h3>
    	  <em>
    	    We sent an email to <strong><%= @new_email %></strong> to verify
    	    that you control the new email.
        </em>
      </h3>
      <p>
      </p>
      <h4>
        In this email you will find a link that, 
        <strong><em><u>when clicked</u></em></strong>, 
        will verify your new email address. Once you have verified your new
        email address you will be asked to verify that you have control of your
        current email so we can be sure your account is secure.
      </h4>
    	<h4>
    	  <strong>
    	    PLEASE check your junk/spam folder before requesting a new email, as 
    	    it is very common to have email delivery problems because of automated
    	    filters.
        </strong>
      </h4>
    	<p>
    	  If for some reason you did not receive the email confirmation, feel 
    	  free to request a new email
    	  <%= link_to 'HERE!', new_email_changes_path %>
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>